@title Edge tones
# Edge tones

A request path with each tone on an edge. The line style still says what kind of edge it is.

diagram arch dir=LR title="Request path"
arch: web "Web tier" svc
arch: api "API" svc focus
arch: db "Orders" db
arch: pay "Payments" ext
arch: web -> api : allow | good
arch: api --> pay : retry | warn
arch: api -x- db : direct writes | bad
arch: api -> db | info
arch: pay -> db : settle | neutral
arch: web -> pay : audit
arch: legend

The same words on messages.

diagram calls sequence title="Gateway calls"
calls: a "Client" user
calls: b "Gateway" svc
calls: c "Auth" svc
calls: a -> b : GET /orders | good
calls: b -> c : verify token | info
calls: c --> b : expired | warn
calls: b --> a : 401 | bad
calls: b -> b : retry | neutral
calls: a -> b : plain
